		such that ${\mathcal L} u=0$ in $2B$ with vanishing Neumann data on $2B\cap {\partial\Omega}$. Then 
		\begin{equation}\label{eq:moser1}
			{\rm osc}_B(u) \leq C\,\;\mathchoice
